Raggust:

This is a RAG project, written exclusively in 100% RUST. To assert dominance.
For this make sure you have a corpus ready, a epub file is required, as I was
too lazy to add support for any other file type

Setup:

You only need ollama for this shit to work.

Pull the embed model:
`ollama pull nomic-embed-text`
Pull the LLM model:
`ollama pull deepseek-r1:1.5b`
Make sure ollama is running
`systemctl enable ollama`

Compile and Enjoy. Premium RAG for premium users. You're welcome.

P.S., Make sure you change the `const` inside the main.rs, rag.rs, embed.rs,
according to your needs.
